# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
# Development happens on Windows and macOS, CI runs on Linux, and `black --check`
# plus shell scripts in the Docker build are sensitive to CRLF. Storing LF keeps
# a local checkout and a CI checkout byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
